  "description": "Armed slots pressed for game 0.6.4's AI (needs League of Legends Heroes): Samira's, Twisted Fate's and Kog'Maw's R and Camille's E only arm or wait for a target in the data, and the 0.6.4 AI almost never presses them. This add-on presses them for the AI - Samira when an enemy champion is in R's range, and she also casts E and Q at champions to climb her Style to S; Twisted Fate when he is alone and an ally far away is fighting an enemy champion; Kog'Maw at the lowest-health champion his R may hit; Camille when an enemy champion is in E's range. Nothing of the main pack is replaced. Writes a log for testing. Also, when the AI holds Camille, Sett or Olaf in lane just out of reach of the enemy laner, it attacks him for them - only at half health or more, away from his tower and not outnumbered.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-17",
  "mod_id": "league_ult_press",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: armed skills pressed and lane holds broken for the AI",
  "version": "0.1.0"
}
